<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">IMAGE EXTRACTOR</view><view class="title">从图片里取色</view><view class="subtitle">上传一张图片，自动提取 8 个主色。颜色可直接复制。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="chooseImage">{{image?'重新选择图片':'选择图片'}}</button></view><view wx:if="{{image}}" class="panel"><image src="{{image}}" mode="aspectFill" style="width:100%;height:420rpx;border-radius:18rpx"></image><view class="section-title">主色板</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted">正在分析图片…</view><view wx:else class="grid"><view wx:for="{{colors}}" wx:key="*this" class="panel" style="padding:12rpx" data-hex="{{item}}" bindtap="copy"><view style="height:120rpx;border-radius:14rpx;background:{{item}}"></view><view class="code" style="font-size:22rpx;margin-top:10rpx">{{item}}</view></view></view></view><view class="panel pro"><view class="row"><view><view class="tag">FREE</view><view class="section-title">今天想多用一点？</view></view><view class="muted">24h Pro</view></view><view class="muted">观看激励广告即可兑换临时 Pro 权益。正式接入广告 SDK 后，成功回调即可发放权益。</view><button class="button" style="margin-top:18rpx;background:#FFF;color:#171714" bindtap="adGate">观看广告兑换</button><view class="ad-note">广告位预留 · 仅在用户主动兑换权益时展示</view></view></view>
